# ---- Theme music (16-AUDIO §4A) ----
# Local scratch folder for tracks you want to hear in dev without adding them to
# the repo. Outside publicDir, so Vite never copies it into a build.
# NOTE: this once held the C418 OST and those files were committed in b74a1b5 —
# they were deleted 2026-07-17, but ignoring a path does NOT untrack it. See
# DEVIATIONS.md "Menu music" for the history-removal command.
CC-assets/CC-sounds/

# public/theme-music/ IS COMMITTED, and ships empty — a clean slate for each user
# to drop their own music into. Anything committed there lands in every clone, so
# please don't push tracks you don't hold the rights to.

# Generated from the theme-music folders by scripts/gen-theme-manifest.mjs.
src/audio/themeManifest.js
